{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*This is only a demo and does not represent the full game*</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171890/extras/Image_Sequence_073_0001.png?t=1742807980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Unsolved is a detective story-driven game where you step into the shoes of an investigator, gathering clues, interrogating suspects, and connecting evidence to solve complex murder cases. Your goal is to uncover the identity of a serial killer who has left a trail of destruction in your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171890/extras/Image_Sequence_078_0001.png?t=1742807980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171890/extras/Movie_118.gif?t=1742807980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Start by gathering clues, whether it\u2019s a weapon, a witness, or a simple note.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171890/extras/Image_Sequence_075_0001.png?t=1742807980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171890/extras/Movie_125.gif?t=1742807980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect the clues you've gathered using a unique mechanic. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3171890?t=1742807980","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171890/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742807980","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171890/2bf3fe241